I go to the window.
The window is tall.
I look outside.
It is already dark.
It is January in Berlin.
The city is big and unfamiliar.
My hand is on the glass.
The glass is very cold.
Outside there is ice on the street.
The winter here is so dark.
I am tired and I am cold.
Suddenly I am sad.
I am homesick.
What am I doing here?
I am from Mexico.
It is warm in Mexico right now.
There is a lot of sun there.
I miss my family.
But I am here now.
This is my new room.
